title: "Ferrite"
description: "Ferrite is new firmware for the Radtel RT-950 Pro, written from scratch. Free, with its source public."
videos:
  - file: tour
    title: "The tour"
    line: "Three slots, the band scope, a channel on one page, crossband, APRS messages, shortwave and Ferrite Console."
  - file: unique
    title: "What only Ferrite does"
    line: "Resting current, APRS that isn't missed, the decoder, FX.25, faster Bluetooth, and a radio built not to brick."
  - file: aprs
    title: "APRS on the radio"
    line: "APRS on slot C beside your two voice slots: the card, beacons, telemetry, FX.25 and messages."
  - file: lowpower
    title: "Low Power Mode"
    line: "One setting for when the battery matters more than features, and one hold to get everything back."
---
<section class="intro">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Ferrite</h1>
    <p class="lead">Free firmware for the <a href="{{ site.radio }}" rel="sponsored">Radtel RT-950 Pro</a>
      (affiliate link), written from scratch, with its source public.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn solid" href="/try/">Try it</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/download/">Download</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap videos">
  {%- for v in videos %}
  <section class="video">
    <h2>{{ v.title }}</h2>
    <p class="sub">{{ v.line }}</p>
    <video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/video/{{ v.file }}.jpg" width="1280" height="720">
      <source src="/video/{{ v.file }}.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      <a href="/video/{{ v.file }}.mp4">Watch “{{ v.title }}” (MP4)</a>
    </video>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
